{"path": "code/S18/JH-S18-041/Main.java", "executed": true, "java": "OpenJDK 21.0.10 (Ubuntu build)", "output": "put existing key returns old value: 1
get a = 10, get b = 2, get missing = null
null key = 99
remove b = 2, size = 2
